    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72163.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "In the book you discuss Israel and anti-Semitism, one of the leading groups whose supporters have mercilessly smeared and attacked you is APAC, which is why I was so surprised to see that you had signed on to an APAC-backed letter calling for an arms embargo on Iran. The justification which I saw from your office was that you consistently support imposing arms embargo on human rights violators. So now I have to ask, do you also support an arms embargo on Israel, which Amnesty International has called for?",
